# Temporary Online Payment Gate

- Online checkout payment is intentionally disabled until the first store release is published and production YooKassa keys are issued by the bank.
- Preserve `lib/services/yookassa_payment_service.dart` and the existing YooKassa server scripts; do not remove them while this gate is active.
- Keep checkout defaulting to `При получении` while online payment is disabled.
- Re-enable online payment only when the user explicitly asks and confirms that working production YooKassa keys are available.
